---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import FramedHero from '../components/FramedHero.astro';
import Enquiry from '../components/Enquiry.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { breadcrumb } from '../lib/schema';
import '../styles/inner.css';

const person = {
  '@type': 'Person',
  name: site.owner,
  jobTitle: 'Filmmaker and founder',
  worksFor: { '@id': site.url + '/#business' },
  url: site.url + '/about/',
};
---
<Base
  title="About Keegan Starkey | Starkey Productions"
  description="Starkey Productions is run by Keegan Starkey, a Milton Keynes filmmaker who plans, shoots and edits every project himself."
  current="about"
  schema={[person, breadcrumb([{ name: 'About', path: '/about/' }])]}
>
  <FramedHero
    aria="About Starkey Productions"
    crumbs={[{ name: 'About' }]}
    photo="/images/about/keegan-2.jpg" photoAlt="Keegan Starkey holding a cinema camera on location"
    title="The person<br>behind the<br>camera" small
    lede="Starkey Productions is run by Keegan Starkey, a filmmaker based in Milton Keynes. The person you speak to on the first call is the one behind the camera and in the edit."
    cta={{ label: 'Start a project', href: '#enquire' }}
    cta2={{ label: 'See the work', href: '/work/' }}
  />

  <section class="sec gut" aria-labelledby="ab-h">
    <h2 class="sr-only" id="ab-h">Why Starkey Productions exists</h2>
    <figure class="ab-quote">
      <blockquote><p><span class="ph">“</span>I picked up a camera because it could hold on to moments that would otherwise be forgotten. Every business has moments like that: the people, the craft, the days that matter. My job is to find them, film them properly and turn them into something people actually <span class="egg egg-focus"><span class="fw-i">watch.</span></span><span class="ph">”</span></p></blockquote>
      <figcaption><i class="rec-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i>Keegan Starkey · Founder</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="sec gut" aria-labelledby="ab2-h">
    <div class="intro">
      <h2 class="h2" id="ab2-h">One filmmaker. End to end.</h2>
      <div>
        <p>That's still the reason behind every Starkey Productions project. Keegan plans, shoots and edits the work himself, which means one point of contact, one consistent look across everything you post, and nobody passing your brief down a line of people who've never met you.</p>
        <p>The work covers product and brand films, event coverage, monthly content for local businesses and documentary work, for clients including Sky Sports News, DAZN and Just Eat. The common thread is the same: find what's worth filming, shoot it properly, and cut it so people watch to the end.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec gut" aria-label="On set">
    <ul class="ab-shots">
      <li><img src="/images/about/keegan-1.jpg" alt="Keegan Starkey setting up a cinema camera on location" loading="lazy" /></li>
      <li><img src="/images/about/keegan-3.jpg" alt="Keegan Starkey filming an interview on location" loading="lazy" /></li>
      <li><img src="/images/about/keegan-4.jpg" alt="Cinema camera rig set up for a shoot" loading="lazy" /></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="sec gut" aria-labelledby="how-h">
    <div class="del-head"><h2 class="h2" id="how-h">How the work gets made</h2></div>
    <ul class="kit">
      <li><h3>Cinema cameras, small footprint</h3><p>Shot on Sony cinema cameras with a compact kit, so you get a premium image without a crew taking over the building.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Made for the web</h3><p>Every film is edited for where it will be watched: landscape for your website and YouTube, vertical for Instagram, TikTok and LinkedIn.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Local by design</h3><p>Based in Milton Keynes, working with businesses across Buckinghamshire, Bedfordshire and Northamptonshire, and travelling UK-wide for events and bigger projects.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="gut" aria-label="Sister brands">
    <div class="band">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Golf and weddings?</p><p class="band-t">They have homes of their own. <span>Golf films live under Bad At Golf, and weddings under Wedding Diaries. Starkey Productions is for businesses, events and the stories behind them.</span></p></div>
      <div class="band-r"><p>Links to both are at the bottom of every page.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Enquiry heading={'Got <span class="egg egg-zebra">something</span><br>worth filming?'} preset="unsure" page="About" />
</Base>
